## How to Apply This Teaching

### Step 1 — Replace wai-plan-validation.md

Replace the content of `.claude/commands/wai-plan-validation.md` with the updated version from the framework's `spoke/managed/templates/commands/wai-plan-validation.md`.

```bash
# From the spoke root (adjust MASTER_PATH as needed).
# NOTE: reads the WAI-State.json wheel.framework_path field, which currently
# points at the deprecated /wheelwright/framework repo. That field itself is
# scheduled for a rename (framework_path -> master_path, or retirement) under
# impl-integrity-w7-retire-framework-term-v1 part 2 — update this read once
# that lands.
MASTER_PATH=$(python3 -c "import json; d=json.load(open('WAI-Harness/spoke/local/WAI-State.json')); print(d['wheel'].get('framework_path') or '')" 2>/dev/null || echo "")
if [ -n "$MASTER_PATH" ]; then
  cp "$MASTER_PATH/spoke/managed/templates/commands/wai-plan-validation.md" .claude/commands/wai-plan-validation.md
  echo "PASS — wai-plan-validation.md updated"
else
  echo "MANUAL — copy mywheel/WAI-Harness/spoke/managed/templates/commands/wai-plan-validation.md to .claude/commands/wai-plan-validation.md"
fi
```

### Step 2 — Replace wai-complexity-gate.md

```bash
if [ -n "$MASTER_PATH" ]; then
  cp "$MASTER_PATH/spoke/managed/templates/commands/wai-complexity-gate.md" .claude/commands/wai-complexity-gate.md
