### Step 3 — Replace wai-lug-schema.md

```bash
if [ -n "$MASTER_PATH" ]; then
  cp "$MASTER_PATH/spoke/managed/templates/commands/wai-lug-schema.md" .claude/commands/wai-lug-schema.md
